                                "sense_id": "b543b276-1036-3520-bd5f-dd2e4e5ac0c8",
                                "text": "He thinks Santa lives at the South Pole? What a stupe!"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "05ca5dce-1a85-452c-b673-3f5c4dcc0238",
                                "sense_id": "b543b276-1036-3520-bd5f-dd2e4e5ac0c8",
                                "text": "George put the phone back on the hook in a hurry, his face burning.\nShe doesn't know it's you, stupe. There's six parties on the line!"
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
